# Third-Party Notices — dendriForge v2

This file records every third-party-derived asset, library, or artwork whose
`[provenance]` metadata declares `source = "third-party"`.

Original drawings (including original IEC 60617-style schematic SVGs) declare
`source = "original"` and do not require an entry here.

Enforcement: `dendri provenance-check` (and `dendri asset-check` from Phase 4)
fails CI if any asset declares `source = "third-party"` without a matching entry
in this file. Assets whose license restricts machine-learning use MUST set
`ml_restricted = true` in `[provenance]` and are excluded from all AI/ML corpora.

